a)  Get your pet back nownownow ;-).  

b)  Use Elbereth and, for not-so-bright monsters, mirrors.  
    Invisibility and protection are also very useful.  If 
    in real trouble, read un-Ided scrolls and zap monsters 
    with Un-Ided wands.  

